# {sign} her sign, {birthday} today/week/soon/no, {role} student/teacher/exteacher/story/exstory.

# ================= your line, per like =================
@rule me.small.animals
on me.small
when likeid=animals
- [Are you a cat person or a dog person?|Do you have any pets?|I saw a stray cat by the gate this morning.]
- [If you could have any animal, what would it be?|Have you been to the cat café by the station?]
- [Do you think dogs dream?|What's the cutest animal you've ever seen?|Would you rather have a cat or a hamster?]

@rule me.small.food
on me.small
when likeid=food
- [What's the best thing you've eaten lately?|Do you have a favorite restaurant?|I'm hungry just thinking about it, but what's your favorite food?]
- [If you could only eat one thing forever, what would it be?|Any good places to eat around here?]
- [Bread from the store, or homemade bento?|What did you have for lunch?|What's a food you could never stand?]

@rule me.small.cooking
on me.small
when likeid=cooking
- [Do you cook?|Did you make your own lunch today?|What's the best thing you can cook?]
- [Could you teach me a recipe sometime?|Do you cook at home a lot?]
- [What's your signature dish?|Ever burned something really badly?|Do you cook for your family?]

@rule me.small.exercise
on me.small
when likeid=exercise
- [Do you work out?|You look like you run a lot.|What sport do you like best?]
- [Morning runs or evening runs?|Ever think about joining a sports club?]
- [How many laps can you run?|Do you stretch before class?|What's your favorite way to stay in shape?]

@rule me.small.study
on me.small
when likeid=study
- [What's your best subject?|Do you study a lot at home?|How do you keep your grades up?]
- [Library or home, where do you study better?|Got any study tricks?]
- [How do you survive exam season?|Which teacher do you think explains best?|Do you study with music on?]

@rule me.small.fashion
on me.small
when likeid=fashion
- [Where do you buy your clothes?|You always look put together.|What's in style these days?]
- [If you weren't in uniform, what would you wear?|Got a favorite brand?]
- [What's the best outfit you own?|Would you ever dye your hair?|Do you dress up on weekends?]

@rule me.small.coffee
on me.small
when likeid=coffee
- [Coffee or tea?|How do you take your coffee?|Do you drink coffee every day?]
- [Know any good cafés?|Can you really drink it black?]
- [Canned coffee from the machine, or the real stuff?|How many cups a day?|Ever had coffee jelly?]

@rule me.small.spicy
on me.small
when likeid=spicy
- [Can you handle spicy food?|What's the spiciest thing you've ever eaten?|Do you like hot curry?]
- [Ever tried the ghost pepper chips?|How spicy do you go at the ramen place?]
- [How many chili peppers can you handle on the menu?|Ever cried eating curry?|Mapo tofu: mild or extra hot?]

@rule me.small.sweets
on me.small
when likeid=sweets
- [Do you have a sweet tooth?|What's your favorite dessert?|Cake or ice cream?]
- [Know any good sweet shops?|Do you bake sweets yourself?]
- [Melon bread or cream puff?|What's the best sweet at the convenience store?|Ever eaten a whole cake by yourself?]

# ================= her answer, per like: she loves it =================
@rule small.animals.yes
on small
when likeid=animals likes=yes
opens ask,invite,share
feel smile
- [Cats! Definitely cats.|I love all animals, honestly.] [There's a stray behind the gym I feed every day.|I want a dog so badly, but my building doesn't allow pets.]
- [Oh, don't get me started on animals.|I could watch animal videos for hours.] [The cat café by the station is my happy place.|Have you seen the ducks in the park? They're so round right now.]
- [I have a hamster named after a samurai.|My grandma's dog likes me more than her.] [I'm not even joking.|It's the best feeling.]
- [Animals are better than people sometimes.|A cat sat on my lap at the park yesterday.] [They don't lie to you.|I didn't move for an hour.]

@rule small.animals.yes.shy
on small
when likeid=animals likes=yes voice=shy|bookish
opens ask,invite,praise
feel shy
- [A-animals? I... I like cats a lot.|Um, I have a little rabbit at home.] [She's very soft.|I talk to her when I'm sad. Is that weird?]
- [Animals don't make me nervous.|I-I volunteer at a shelter on Sundays.] [Not like people.|Please don't tell anyone.]
- [Animals are easier than people.|My cat sleeps on my homework.] [They don't judge you.|I-I don't mind. Much.]

@rule small.animals.no
on small
when likeid=animals likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [Animals? I'm allergic to half of them.|I'm more of a... not-animal person.] [Cats make me sneeze.|They're cute from far away.]
- [A dog chased me when I was little.|Animals don't like me, for some reason.] [I still haven't forgiven it.|Maybe they can tell.]
- [I'd rather watch animal videos than meet one.|Fish are fine. They stay in the tank.] [Much safer.|That's my limit.]

@rule small.food.yes
on small
when likeid=food likes=yes
opens ask,invite,share
feel smile
- [Food is life.|Okay, my favorite food? That's a hard one.] [I think about lunch from the moment I wake up.|There's a yakitori stand near my house that's unreal.]
- [I'm always hungry, it's a problem.|I rank every bento I see.] [Don't judge.|Yours looks like a seven, by the way.]
- [Have you tried the new crepe stand?|There's a ramen place by the station that's open until two.] [I've been three times this week.|The broth is life-changing.]
- [I'd eat anything once.|My dream is a food tour around the country.] [Except natto. Never natto.|Osaka first, obviously.]

@rule small.food.no
on small
when likeid=food likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [Food? I eat to live, that's all.|I'm a picky eater, honestly.] [Rice and miso and I'm done.|Most things are too greasy for me.]
- [I forget to eat half the time.|I don't get people who photograph their food.] [My mom worries about it.|Just eat it!]
- [I could live on toast, honestly.|Food's not really my thing.] [Plain toast.|I'd rather sleep than eat.]

@rule small.cooking.yes
on small
when likeid=cooking likes=yes
opens ask,invite,praise
feel smile
- [I made this bento myself, actually.|I cook dinner for my family most days.] [The tamagoyaki took three tries.|My little brother is a harsh critic.]
- [Cooking is how I relax.|I'm trying to perfect my curry.] [Chopping vegetables is weirdly calming.|The secret is grated apple. Don't tell anyone.]
- [I want to try baking bread next.|I watch cooking videos before bed.] [The home ec room has a real oven.|It's my guilty pleasure.]
- [If you ever want something homemade, just ask.|I could cook for you sometime.] [I always make too much.|If you're brave.]

@rule small.cooking.no
on small
when likeid=cooking likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [I burned instant noodles once.|Cooking? Me? I can boil water.] [Somehow.|On a good day.]
- [The kitchen and I aren't friends.|My mom banned me from the stove.] [We have an understanding.|For good reasons.]
- [I set off the smoke alarm making toast.|Convenience stores exist for people like me.] [Toast!|Bless them.]

@rule small.exercise.yes
on small
when likeid=exercise likes=yes
opens ask,invite,tease
feel smile
- [I run every morning before school.|I did a hundred push-ups last night.] [It clears my head.|My arms are still shaking.]
- [Sports are the best part of school.|I want to beat my record on the track.] [Everything else is just waiting for P.E.|Twelve seconds flat. I'll get it.]
- [You should come running with me.|Sweating feels great, honestly.] [If you can keep up.|Don't make that face.]
- [I'm thinking of trying swimming next.|Stretching every night is my secret.] [The pool's always free after club.|That's why I'm so flexible.]

@rule small.exercise.no
on small
when likeid=exercise likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [Exercise? I get tired climbing the stairs.|P.E. is my least favorite class.] [The courtyard stairs are my enemy.|Every single time.]
- [I'm more of an indoor person.|Running for fun? I don't get it.] [Sweat is gross.|Nobody's chasing you.]
- [My idea of sport is walking to the vending machine.|I hide during the marathon every year.] [Twice if I'm thirsty.|Nobody's found my spot yet.]

@rule small.study.yes
on small
when likeid=study likes=yes
opens ask,invite,praise
feel smile
- [I actually like studying, is that weird?|Math is my favorite, honestly.] [There's always an answer.|Solving a hard problem feels amazing.]
- [I'm reading ahead in the history book.|I have color-coded notes for everything.] [It's like a story.|Want to borrow them?]
- [The library's my second home.|I'm aiming for the top ten this term.] [The corner desk by the window is mine.|Don't tell anyone I said that.]
- [Teaching someone else is the best way to learn.|I could help you study sometime.] [I mean it.|If you want.]

@rule small.study.no
on small
when likeid=study likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [Studying? Please, I'm on vacation in my head.|Don't say the word "study" near me.] [Until the exams, anyway.|It gives me hives.]
- [I fall asleep the moment I open a textbook.|My notes are mostly doodles.] [It's a gift.|Want to see?]
- [I study the night before. Every time.|Grades are a social construct.] [It works. Kind of.|Tell that to my mom.]

@rule small.fashion.yes
on small
when likeid=fashion likes=yes
opens ask,invite,praise
feel smile
- [I'm saving up for a coat I saw at the station.|I check the new arrivals every weekend.] [It's this perfect beige.|The shop girls know my name.]
- [I altered my uniform a little, can you tell?|Accessories make the outfit.] [Just the skirt length.|This hairpin cost me a week's allowance.]
- [I read every fashion magazine I can find.|Street style is so much better than runway.] [I want to be a stylist one day.|Don't you think?]
- [You'd look good in a darker jacket.|Can I fix your collar?] [Just saying.|There. Much better.]

@rule small.fashion.no
on small
when likeid=fashion likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [Fashion? I wear whatever's clean.|I own three hoodies and I'm happy.] [It's efficient.|Why have more?]
- [Uniforms are great, I don't have to choose.|I don't get trends at all.] [Best rule this school has.|They change every week.]
- [I don't even know what's trendy right now.|My sister picks my clothes.] [And I don't care.|I just wear them.]

@rule small.coffee.yes
on small
when likeid=coffee likes=yes
opens ask,invite,share
feel smile
- [Black coffee, no sugar.|I have two cups before school.] [It's the only way.|Three on exam days.]
- [There's a little café by the station with real beans.|I'm trying pour-over at home.] [The owner knows my order.|My kitchen smells amazing.]
- [People say it's bitter, but that's the point.|Canned coffee is a crime.] [Sweet coffee is dessert.|Fight me.]
- [We should go get coffee sometime.|I know a place that does latte art.] [My treat.|The barista draws cats.]

@rule small.coffee.no
on small
when likeid=coffee likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [Coffee's too bitter for me.|I'm a tea person, sorry.] [I need lots of milk.|Green tea forever.]
- [Coffee makes my heart race.|I tried black coffee once.] [I don't need that.|Never again.]
- [Coffee smells good, but tastes awful.|I'm happy with juice.] [It's a scam.|Strawberry milk, preferably.]

@rule small.spicy.yes
on small
when likeid=spicy likes=yes
opens ask,invite,tease
feel smile
- [The spicier the better!|I put chili oil on everything.] [Level ten curry, no water.|Even my rice.]
- [There's a ramen place with a hell-fire challenge.|I beat the spicy chips challenge last week.] [My name's on their wall.|My friends were crying for me.]
- [Spicy food makes me feel alive.|I sweat, I cry, I love it.] [Is that strange?|Every time.]
- [Bet you can't handle what I eat.|We should do a spicy food challenge.] [Prove me wrong.|Loser pays.]

@rule small.spicy.no
on small
when likeid=spicy likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [Spicy? I can't even handle wasabi.|Mild curry, please. Kids' level.] [My tongue is weak.|Don't laugh.]
- [I don't get spicy food at all.|It's just pain with flavor.] [Why would you hurt yourself?|No thanks.]
- [Last time I tried spicy ramen I cried.|I order the kids' curry. Proudly.] [Real tears.|Judge me.]

@rule small.sweets.yes
on small
when likeid=sweets likes=yes
opens ask,invite,share
feel smile
- [Sweets are my weakness.|I have a secret stash of chocolate in my desk.] [Any kind, any time.|Don't tell anyone.]
- [The cake shop by the station has a strawberry shortcake to die for.|Parfaits are the best invention.] [I go there every Friday.|The tall ones especially.]
- [Melon bread counts as a sweet, right?|I'm learning to make macarons.] [It's my lunch half the time.|They keep cracking.]
- [Sharing dessert is the best way to make friends.|I always order two desserts.] [Want half?|One's never enough.]

@rule small.sweets.no
on small
when likeid=sweets likes=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [Sweets make my teeth hurt.|I'm more of a salty snack person.] [Too much sugar.|Rice crackers are the best.]
- [I can't eat a whole cake slice.|Chocolate's okay. A little.] [Too heavy.|Just one piece.]
- [I give my chocolates away on Valentine's.|Too sweet makes me feel sick.] [Well, the ones I get.|Bitter's better.]

# ================= the new subjects =================
@rule me.small.club
on me.small
when subject=club
- [How's the {club}?|Anything new at the {club}?|Is the {club} fun?]
- [What do you guys do at the {club}, anyway?|Busy at the {club} lately?]
- [Does the {club} need more people?|What's the hardest part of the {club}?|Are you the best one at the {club}?]

@rule small.club
on small
when subject=club
opens ask,praise,invite
- [The {club}? It's going well.|We're busy at the {club}.] [We've got new members this term.|There's a big thing coming up.]
- [Honestly, the {club}'s the best part of my day.|The {club} keeps me sane.] [Everyone there's so fun.|Even when it's hard.]
- [The {club} is like a second home.|Things are a bit messy at the {club}.] [Some days I stay till dark.|But we'll manage.]

@rule small.club.sports
on small
when subject=club clubkind=sports
opens ask,praise,invite
feel smile
- [Practice is brutal, but I love it.|The {club} has a tournament soon.] [Coach makes us run till we drop.|We're training every day.]
- [I finally beat my best time in the {club}!|My muscles hate the {club} right now.] [I wanted to tell someone.|But it's worth it.]
- [We lost last match, but barely.|The {club} captain is a monster.] [Next time we win.|In a good way. Mostly.]

@rule small.club.culture
on small
when subject=club clubkind=culture
opens ask,praise,invite
feel smile
- [We're working on something big at the {club}.|The {club} is quiet, but I like it.] [I can't say what yet.|It's like a little hideout.]
- [You should drop by the {club} sometime.|The {club} is short on members.] [We have snacks.|Want to join?]
- [The {club} room smells like old paper.|We're making something for the festival.] [I love it.|Come see it when it's done.]

@rule small.club.teacher
on small
when subject=club role=teacher
opens ask,praise,share
- [I'm advising the {club} this year.|The {club} kids keep me busy.] [They're a handful.|I'm proud of them, though.]
- [Being a club advisor is more work than people think.|The {club} needs a new budget, sigh.] [Paperwork, mostly.|Don't tell the principal I complained.]
- [The {club} kids made me a card last week.|I wish the {club} had more time.] [I didn't cry. Much.|Exams eat everything.]

@rule me.small.friend
on me.small
when subject=friend
- [You and {bff} are close, huh?|How's {bff} doing?|I always see you with {bff}.]
- [How did you and {bff} meet?|Is {bff} your best friend?]
- [Do you hang out with {bff} after school?|{Bff} talks about you, you know.|What's {bff} like when nobody's around?]

@rule small.friend
on small
when subject=friend
opens ask,praise,tease
feel smile
- [{Bff}? She's the best.|Me and {bff}? We've been together forever.] [She'd do anything for me.|We met in first year.]
- [{Bff} drives me crazy sometimes.|{Bff} is a disaster, but she's my disaster.] [I love her anyway.|Don't tell her I said that.]
- [{Bff} and I are going shopping this weekend.|{Bff} has a crush on someone, I think.] [Wanna come?|She won't tell me who.]

@rule small.friend.jealous
on small
when subject=friend interest=yes
opens ask,comfort,praise
feel pout
- [{Bff}? Why, are you interested in her?|You ask about {bff} a lot.] [Just asking.|...Hm.]
- [{Bff}'s great. Everyone likes her.|I'd introduce you, but...] [Maybe too great.|Maybe not.]
- [Do you want her number or something?|You never ask about me like that.] [Kidding.|...Forget it.]

@rule me.small.birthday
on me.small
when subject=birthday
- [When's your birthday, anyway?|Isn't your birthday around now?|Do you do anything for your birthday?]
- [What would you want for your birthday?|Is it true your birthday's coming up?]
- [Do you like birthday cake?|Best birthday you ever had?|Do your friends throw you parties?]

@rule small.birthday.today
on small
when subject=birthday birthday=today
opens praise,invite,thank
feel smile
- [It's today, actually!|You remembered? It's today!] [Nobody else said anything.|I'm so happy right now.]
- [Today! I'm a year older today.|How did you know?] [Spoil me a little?|Did someone tell you?]
- [Yes! Today's my day!|It's today! Can you believe it?] [You're the first to say anything.|Make it a good one with me?]

@rule small.birthday.week
on small
when subject=birthday birthday=week
opens ask,invite,praise
feel smile
- [It's this week! You noticed?|My birthday's in a few days.] [I want cake. Lots of cake.|I'm pretending I don't care.]
- [This week, yeah.|I'm turning a year older this week.] [Any ideas for a present?|Don't make a fuss, okay? ...Maybe a little fuss.]
- [In a few days! I can't wait.|This week. My mom's already baking.] [I'm counting down.|You could come by. Maybe.]

@rule small.birthday.soon
on small
when subject=birthday birthday=soon
opens ask,invite,tease
- [Next week, actually.|It's coming up soon.] [I haven't planned anything.|Are you asking for a reason?]
- [Soon. I'm already making a wish list.|Next week. Don't forget.] [Just kidding. Mostly.|I'm watching you.]
- [Soon. Not that I'm hinting.|It's coming. I'll be expecting something.] [Okay, I'm hinting.|Hehe.]

@rule small.birthday.no
on small
when subject=birthday birthday=no
opens ask,share,tease
- [My birthday? It's still a while away.|Not for a long time, sadly.] [Why, planning something?|I'll remind you.]
- [My birthday's not soon, don't worry.|It's months away.] [You've got time to think of a present.|Ask me again later.]
- [Ages away. Ask me again in a few months.|My birthday's not close at all.] [You'll have forgotten by then.|But thanks for asking.]

@rule me.small.horoscope
on me.small
when subject=horoscope
- [Do you read your horoscope?|What's your sign?|Do you believe in horoscopes?]
- [What did your horoscope say today?|Are you into astrology?]
- [Do you think our signs get along?|Have you ever had a horoscope come true?|Is it true you check horoscopes?]

@rule small.horoscope
on small
when subject=horoscope sign=*
opens ask,tease,share
- [I'm a {sign}. Can you tell?|{Sign}, born and raised.] [People say it fits me.|Don't say anything mean.]
- [I check it every morning. I'm a {sign}.|Horoscopes are silly, but... I'm a {sign}.] [Today it said something good.|And I read it every day.]
- [{Sign}. Today's lucky color is pink, apparently.|I'm a {sign}. We're supposed to be romantic.] [I'm wearing it, see?|Supposed to be.]

@rule small.horoscope.cool
on small
when subject=horoscope voice=cool|serious|proper
opens ask,share
- [I don't believe in that. ...I'm a {sign}, though.|Astrology is nonsense.] [For the record.|My sign is {sign}, if you must know.]
- [Horoscopes are vague on purpose.|Stars don't decide my day.] [But fine, {sign}.|I do.]
- [I'm a {sign}. The descriptions never fit me.|Astrology is a business, nothing more.] [Which proves my point.|...Still, I'm a {sign}.]

@rule me.small.teaching
on me.small
when subject=teaching
- [Is teaching hard?|Why did you become a teacher?|Do you like teaching?]
- [What's the worst part of being a teacher?|Do students ever drive you crazy?]
- [What were you like as a student?|Do you have favorite students?|Is grading as boring as it looks?]

@rule small.teaching
on small
when subject=teaching role=teacher
opens ask,praise,comfort
- [Teaching is rewarding. Exhausting, but rewarding.|I wanted to be the teacher I never had.] [When a student finally gets it, it's worth everything.|That's the dream, anyway.]
- [The grading never ends.|Some days I wonder why I chose this.] [But then someone like you says hello.|Then I remember.]
- [Every class is different.|I still get nervous on the first day of term.] [That's what keeps it fun.|Don't tell anyone.]

@rule small.teaching.ex
on small
when subject=teaching role=exteacher
opens ask,share,comfort
- [Teaching? That's behind me now.|I miss it sometimes.] [Being a student again is strange.|The chalk dust, mostly.]
- [I learned more from my students than they learned from me.|I don't know if I'll go back.] [Funny, right?|We'll see.]
- [I still dream about grading papers.|Sitting on this side of the desk is humbling.] [Nightmares, really.|Very humbling.]

@rule me.small.future
on me.small
when subject=future
- [What do you want to do after school?|Got any plans for the future?|What's your dream?]
- [Where do you see yourself in five years?|University, or work?]
- [Do you know what you want to be?|Any dream jobs?|Do you think you'll stay in this town?]

@rule small.future
on small
when subject=future
opens ask,praise,share
- [After school? I'm not sure yet.|I want to go to university.] [Maybe something with {fav}.|Somewhere far away.]
- [I've thought about it a lot.|My parents want me to take over the family shop.] [I'm scared, honestly.|I haven't decided.]
- [I want to do something that matters.|No idea. Is that bad?] [I just don't know what yet.|Everyone else seems so sure.]

@rule small.future.gf
on small
when subject=future rel=girlfriend
opens ask,praise,invite
feel shy
- [My future? I was kind of hoping you'd be in it.|Whatever I do, I want to do it near you.] [Is that too much?|There, I said it.]
- [We could go to the same university.|I've thought about us after graduation.] [Wouldn't that be nice?|A little.]
- [Whatever happens, I'm keeping you.|I've already picked a name for our cat.] [You can't escape.|Don't laugh!]

# ================= her reaction to an invite, by what it is and who she is =================
@rule react.invite.like.good
on react
when move=invite fit=good kind=small likes=yes
feel smile
- [{Likedo}? With you? Yes!|You want to {likedo}? I'm in.] [I know exactly when.|You'd better not back out.]
- [Okay, we're definitely going to {likedo}.|I've wanted someone to {likedo} with forever.] [This is happening.|Finally!]
- [You want to {likedo}? With me?|Say no more. We're going to {likedo}.] [Yes, yes, yes!|I'm already excited.]
- [Let's {likedo}! I know just the place.|You want to {likedo} with me? Yes!] [You won't regret it.|I'll show you everything about {like}.]
- [Nobody ever wants to {likedo} with me.|I've been dying to {likedo} with someone.] [This is great!|Really?]
- [Then I'll bring my favorite {like} stuff.|You're serious about {like}, then?] [Hehe!|This'll be fun.]
- [If you get bored of {like}, it's too late.|Once we start with {like}, there's no going back.] [Warning you.|Hehe.]
- [Saturday? We could {likedo} all day.|Let's {likedo} after school.] [I can't wait.|Okay!]

@rule react.invite.like.gf
on react
when move=invite fit=good rel=girlfriend
feel smile
- [A date? Of course, silly.|You don't even have to ask.] [I'm your girlfriend.|Pick me up after class.]
- [Yes. Always yes.|Anywhere with you is fine.] [I'll wear something cute.|Hold my hand on the way, okay?]
- [Of course I'll go with you.|You and me? Obviously.] [Where are we going?|I was hoping you'd ask.]
- [A date! And {like}! I'm so happy.|You remembered about {like}?] [I love you.|Hehe.]
- [Of course. You don't even have to ask me.|Hey, you're my boyfriend. Silly.] [When?|Just tell me when.]
- [I'll wear the outfit you like.|Should I dress up for you?] [Hehe.|It's a date.]
- [Take me anywhere, as long as it's with you.|Anywhere's good with you.] [I mean it.|Hehe.]

@rule react.invite.acq.neutral
on react
when move=invite fit=neutral rel=acquaintance
- [Hmm, we don't really know each other yet.|That's kind of sudden.] [Maybe with a few other people?|Let's talk a bit more first.]
- [Just the two of us? Hm.|I don't usually go out with boys I just met.] [I'll think about it.|Ask me again sometime.]
- [Hmm. Not yet, I think.|That's a big step for people who barely talk.] [But I'm not saying never.|Let's get to know each other first.]
- [We don't really know each other yet.|We've only talked a few times.] [Maybe after a while?|Let's see.]
- [Hm, that's a bit quick.|You're moving fast.] [Talk to me a little more first.|Ask me again later.]
- [Would it just be us?|Are other people going?] [I'd feel better with a group.|I'm just asking.]
- [Let's start with lunch, maybe.|What about something simple first?] [Then we'll see.|Okay?]
- [I don't say yes to people I hardly know.|I'd need to know you better.] [No offense.|Sorry.]

@rule react.invite.teacher
on react
when move=invite role=teacher
feel shy
- [I'm your teacher. I can't just go out with a student.|That's... not appropriate.] [...Outside school, maybe. Quietly.|Ask me after graduation.]
- [A student asking me out? Ahem.|I'll pretend I didn't hear that.] [...Mostly.|...Where, though? Just curious.]
- [Mr... no. Let's not.|That's very flattering, but no.] [People would talk.|...For now.]
- [I'm your teacher, remember?|As your teacher, I shouldn't say yes to that.] [Careful.|Hmm.]
- [What would the other teachers say?|If the principal heard that...] [Don't get me in trouble.|Keep it down.]
- [Is your homework done?|Finish your assignments, and then we'll talk.] [Hehe.|That's an order.]
- [You shouldn't say that at school.|Not here.] [Lower your voice.|Someone could hear.]
- [You're a bold student.|Students don't usually ask me things like that.] [I'll pretend I didn't hear.|Hm.]

@rule react.invite.exteacher
on react
when move=invite role=exteacher fit=good|neutral
feel smile
- [I'm not your teacher anymore, so... why not?|No rules against it now.] [Don't call me sensei on the way.|It's still a little strange.]
- [It's strange, being asked out by a former student.|I suppose I can say yes now.] [Strange, but nice.|Don't make it weird.]
- [Well, I'm just a student now too.|Why not? We're both students now.] [I'd like that.|Don't tell my old colleagues.]

@rule react.invite.bday
on react
when move=invite subject=birthday birthday=today|week|soon fit=good|neutral
feel smile
- [You'd celebrate with me?|For my birthday? Really?] [That's the best present already.|I'll pick the cake!]
- [My birthday with you... yeah, I'd like that.|You'd remember the day?] [I'll hold you to it.|Okay. It's a promise.]
- [For my birthday? You're sweet.|Celebrating together? I'd love that.] [Don't be late.|You just made my week.]
- [For my birthday? You remembered!|You'd spend my birthday with me?] [I'm so happy.|Really?]
- [I wasn't expecting anyone to care about my birthday.|Nobody's offered to do anything for my birthday yet.] [You're the first.|Thanks.]
- [Is there going to be cake?|I want cake. That's my only condition.] [Hehe.|Deal?]
- [Don't spend too much, okay?|You don't need to get me anything.] [Just being there is enough.|But I won't stop you.]
- [I'll keep that day free for you.|Then that day is yours.] [Hehe.|Don't forget.]

# ================= her reaction to asking, by subject =================
@rule react.ask.friend
on react
when move=ask subject=friend fit=good|neutral
opens tease,praise,invite
- [{Bff} and I met on the first day. She sat in my seat.|{Bff}? She's loud, kind, and terrible at math.] [We've been inseparable since.|I love her.]
- [{Bff} and I do everything together.|{Bff} would like you, I think.] [Shopping, karaoke, homework.|Maybe a little too much.]
- [{Bff}? She's the only one who knows all my secrets.|{Bff} saved me in middle school.] [Don't tell her I said that.|Long story.]
- [{Bff} and I met in first year.|With {bff}, it just clicked.] [We've been stuck together since.|I don't know why.]
- [{Bff} knows all my secrets.|There's nothing I don't tell {bff}.] [That's kind of scary.|Almost nothing.]
- [We usually just walk home and talk about nothing.|Mostly {bff} and I just kill time together.] [It's the best part of my day.|It's nice.]
- [{Bff} is louder than you'd think.|You should see {bff} when nobody's looking.] [Hehe.|Don't say I told you.]
- [Why so curious about {bff}?|Want me to introduce you to {bff}?] [Hm?|Careful.]

@rule react.ask.friend.jealous
on react
when move=ask subject=friend interest=yes
feel pout
- [Why do you want to know so much about {bff}?|Should I be worried about you and {bff}?] [Just asking.|...Hmph.]
- [{Bff} is taken. Probably.|Ask her yourself, then.] [...I'm kidding. Mostly.|...Not really.]
- [Is {bff} more interesting than me?|You could just ask about me, you know.] [Rude.|I'm right here.]
- [Why are you asking me about {bff}?|Are you interested in {bff}, or what?] [Just curious.|Hm.]
- [{Bff} is great. Too great, maybe.|Everyone likes {bff}.] [Why would you want to know?|Hmph.]
- [You could ask about me, you know.|I'm right here, and you're asking about {bff}?]
- [Should I be worried about you and {bff}?|Is this why you came to talk to me?] [Be honest.|Hm?]
- [Fine, {bff} is nice. Happy?|I'm not saying any more about {bff}.] [Now talk about something else.|Next topic.]

@rule react.ask.birthday
on react
when move=ask subject=birthday fit=good|neutral
opens invite,praise,tease
feel smile
- [What I want? Something small. Something you pick.|Usually just cake with my family.] [It's the thought.|But I wouldn't say no to more.]
- [Last year nobody remembered.|I always make a wish on the candles.] [So this year, maybe you will.|I won't tell you what it is.]
- [I'd like something you picked yourself.|Honestly? Just spending the day with someone.] [That's all.|That would be enough.]
- [I don't need much for my birthday.|I usually keep my birthday simple.] [Cake, maybe.|Just friends and food.]
- [Nobody ever remembers my birthday.|My birthday usually gets lost in the shuffle.] [So thanks for asking.|Hehe.]
- [My family makes a fuss about it.|We always have dinner at home on my birthday.] [It's embarrassing.|It's nice, though.]
- [Are you planning something?|Why do you ask? Is there a surprise?] [Hehe.|Tell me!]
- [If you're asking what I want, {fav}.|Anything to do with {fav}.] [Hint, hint.|You know me.]

@rule react.ask.horoscope
on react
when move=ask subject=horoscope fit=good|neutral
opens tease,share,invite
- [It says {sign}s are loyal and stubborn.|Today's said to watch for a surprise.] [Accurate.|Maybe that's you.]
- [Do our signs match? Let me think...|Fate? Maybe a little.] [Probably not, ha!|You're here, aren't you?]
- [Mine said I'd meet someone important.|Apparently my lucky item today is an umbrella.] [Hm. Interesting.|It's not even raining.]
- [{Sign}s are supposed to be stubborn.|I'm a {sign}, so I'm told I'm trouble.] [It's kind of true.|Hehe.]
- [Today's said I'd have a meeting with someone important.|Mine said to watch for an unexpected encounter.] [Hm.|Is that you?]
- [I read it every morning, but I only believe the good ones.|I only trust it when it's nice to me.] [Everyone does that.|Hehe.]
- [What's your sign? Let me see if we match.|Tell me yours, and I'll tell you what it means.] [I've got a chart.|Come on.]
- [Fate or not, it's fun.|I don't really believe it, but I don't skip it either.] [Don't laugh.|Mm.]

@rule react.ask.club
on react
when move=ask subject=club fit=good|neutral
opens invite,praise,share
- [The {club} is preparing for the festival.|We've got a small team, but we're close.] [It's a secret, though.|Everyone pulls their weight.]
- [We could always use more people in the {club}.|I do a bit of everything at the {club}.] [Interested?|Mostly the boring parts.]
- [The {club} is where I can be myself.|We need someone strong in the {club}.] [It's hard to explain.|Know anyone?]
- [The {club} is preparing for something big.|We've got a lot going on in the {club}.] [I can't say more.|It's exhausting, but fun.]
- [I joined the {club} on a whim.|I got dragged into the {club} in first year.] [Now I can't leave.|I don't regret it.]
- [Everyone in the {club} is a little strange.|The people in the {club} are the best part.] [I fit right in.|Hehe.]
- [We could always use more people in the {club}.|Thinking of joining the {club}?] [Come and see.|Hm?]
- [My favorite part of the {club}?|What I like most about the {club}?] [When it's over, and we all go get food.|The quiet after everyone leaves.]

@rule react.share.like.yes
on react
when move=share likes=yes fit=good
feel smile
- [You like {like} too? No way!|Finally someone who gets it.] [We should {likedo} sometime.|I knew I liked you.]
- [Wait, you know about {like}?|You actually listened to me.] [Okay, you're cool.|That's rare.]
- [You like {like}?! I'm so happy!|No way, I thought nobody liked {like}.] [Tell me everything.|We have to talk more.]
- [Finally, someone who gets {like}!|You really do like {like}, then.] [I knew I liked you.|We'll get along.]
- [Wait, I want to hear your opinion on {like}.|So what's your favorite thing about {like}?] [Tell me.|Come on.]
- [We should {likedo} together sometime.|You and I need to {likedo}.] [Seriously.|It's decided.]
- [Nobody in my class gets it about {like}.|I never get to talk about {like} like this.] [This is great.|I'm so happy.]
- [You're not just saying that about {like}, right?|You're not making fun of {like}, are you?] [Good.|Okay.]

@rule react.share.like.no
on react
when move=share likes=no fit=good|neutral
- [See? You get it. {Like} is overrated.|At least we agree on that.] [Let's find something else.|What do you actually like?]
- [You're not into {like} either? Ha.|Good, I thought I was the only one.] [We're boring together.|Let's be weird together.]
- [{Like}? Yeah, no. Same.|Not a fan of {like} either?] [We think alike.|High five.]
- [Ha, you sound more into {like} than I am.|You may like {like} more than I do.] [Good for you.|Fair.]
- [Well, I never really got {like}.|I can't say I share your taste for {like}.] [But okay.|Maybe you could show me.]
- [Maybe I've just been doing {like} wrong.|Is {like} really that good?] [Convince me.|Hm.]
- [I'd rather {favdo}, honestly.|Give me {fav} any day.] [No offense.|Sorry.]
- [I respect it, even if {like} isn't for me.|Everyone has their thing, and {like} is yours.] [Heh.|Fine by me.]
